== Mathematical Origin ==

The Yukawa static field profile from [[ψ Green's Functions]] (A6):

:<math>\psi(r) = -\frac{G_\psi Q_\psi}{r}\,e^{-r/L_\psi}</math>

Inside a shield material of thickness <math>d</math> with coherence length <math>L_\psi^{\rm (shield)} = 1/m_{\rm eff}^{\rm (shield)}</math>, an incident plane ψ wave of amplitude <math>\psi_0</math> decays as:

:<math>\psi(d) = \psi_0\,e^{-d/L_\psi^{\rm (shield)}}</math>

Shielding effectiveness:

:<math>\boxed{SE_\psi = 20\log_{10}\!\left(e^{d/L_\psi}\right) = \frac{20\ln(e)}{\ln(10)}\frac{d}{L_\psi} \approx 8.686\,\frac{d}{L_\psi}\;\text{dB}}</math>

To achieve target SE_ψ, required shield thickness:

:<math>d = L_\psi^{\rm (shield)} \times \frac{SE_\psi}{8.686}</math>

